<section>
    <h3>Where does the recorder sit?</h3>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 964 330" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width: 100%; max-height: 420px;" font-family="sans-serif" role="img" aria-label="Chain of HTTP clients: your code, http_client, RecorderHttpClient, transport, third-party API">
        <defs>
            <marker id="arr-pos" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
                <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#7A6F66"/>
            </marker>
        </defs>

        <rect x="10" y="40" width="150" height="84" rx="10" fill="#FFFDF7" stroke="#E6D9C3" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <text x="85" y="76" text-anchor="middle" fill="#1F1A17" font-size="18" font-weight="bold">Your code</text>
        <text x="85" y="100" text-anchor="middle" fill="#7A6F66" font-size="14">service, controller</text>

        <rect x="196" y="40" width="150" height="84" rx="10" fill="#FFFDF7" stroke="#E6D9C3" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <text x="271" y="76" text-anchor="middle" fill="#1F1A17" font-size="18" font-weight="bold">http_client</text>
        <text x="271" y="100" text-anchor="middle" fill="#7A6F66" font-size="14">scoped, retry…</text>

        <rect x="382" y="40" width="200" height="84" rx="10" fill="#FFE8D6" stroke="#E8590C" stroke-width="2.5"/>
        <text x="482" y="76" text-anchor="middle" fill="#1F1A17" font-size="17" font-weight="bold">RecorderHttpClient</text>
        <text x="482" y="100" text-anchor="middle" fill="#E8590C" font-size="14" font-weight="bold">new</text>

        <rect x="618" y="40" width="150" height="84" rx="10" fill="#FFFDF7" stroke="#E6D9C3" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <text x="693" y="76" text-anchor="middle" fill="#1F1A17" font-size="18" font-weight="bold">Transport</text>
        <text x="693" y="100" text-anchor="middle" fill="#7A6F66" font-size="14">curl, amp…</text>

        <rect x="804" y="40" width="150" height="84" rx="10" fill="#2B2321"/>
        <text x="879" y="88" text-anchor="middle" fill="#FFFDF7" font-size="18" font-weight="bold">Third-party API</text>

        <line class="flow" x1="160" y1="82" x2="192" y2="82" stroke="#7A6F66" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-pos)"/>
        <line class="flow" x1="346" y1="82" x2="378" y2="82" stroke="#7A6F66" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-pos)"/>
        <line class="flow" x1="582" y1="82" x2="614" y2="82" stroke="#7A6F66" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-pos)"/>
        <line class="flow" x1="768" y1="82" x2="800" y2="82" stroke="#7A6F66" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-pos)"/>

        <g class="fragment">
            <line x1="482" y1="124" x2="482" y2="170" stroke="#E8590C" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 4"/>
            <rect x="212" y="170" width="540" height="140" rx="10" fill="#FFFDF7" stroke="#E8590C" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <text x="236" y="202" fill="#1F1A17" font-size="17" font-weight="bold">Innermost decorator of http_client.transport</text>
            <text x="236" y="234" fill="#6B5E55" font-size="16">→ sees absolute URLs (after ScopingHttpClient)</text>
            <text x="236" y="262" fill="#6B5E55" font-size="16">→ below the decorators: scoped, retry, your options</text>
            <text x="236" y="290" fill="#6B5E55" font-size="16">→ a single file for all the clients of the test</text>
        </g>
    </svg>
    <aside class="notes">
        The recorder is plugged in as close to the network as possible, like the mock transport. Every client, default and scoped, goes through it. The decorated client keeps its own default options: the request is only normalised to compute its key. Without the attribute on the test, it is in passthrough mode: it lets everything through.
    </aside>
</section>
